    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a7b839530d5544c5883d1b30bc9a371f",
      "statement": "Secret material is ignored by extension (*.pem, *.key, *.pfx, *.p12, *.snk, *.user) along with appsettings.Development.json and the runtime state directories (.sebastian/, bin/, obj/, .archify/), which is why GitHub:PrivateKeyPath is configured as a path rather than inline key material.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.gitignore#L1-L20",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7b83f332eb8fd435478d760cbb4b7a506150f581351ab4a24ab6c94d85fc73c3:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c4a34f5625dc4418a5f2279e12e6f228",
      "statement": "GitHubService validates the GitHub credentials by construction — it reads the file at GitHub:PrivateKeyPath with File.ReadAllText, imports it with RSA.ImportFromPem, and builds the installation token provider — and Program.cs resolves it eagerly after Build() so a missing or malformed PEM fails the start rather than the first job.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Program.cs#L42-L44",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c929e30b2209c342f3a1782e8af22f55dd8f0bbbdd57b6997d044e750f1f5eee:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/GitHub/GitHubService.cs#L23-L38",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:918ac9ffdfb965cdb6c2cfc95cabe480f1e34a819d167361d3b1c3370247b38e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c24f107d0ee64a3792b2bc19c62c5ba4",
      "statement": "ProviderResolver's constructor is the startup admission gate for model configuration and throws distinct messages for an empty provider list (\"At least one agent provider must be configured.\"), a duplicate case-insensitive name (\"Agent provider '<name>' is configured more than once.\"), a selection matching no entry (\"Agent provider '<name>' is not configured.\"), and a non-absolute endpoint (\"Agent provider '<name>' has an invalid endpoint.\").",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Agent/ProviderResolver.cs#L25-L47",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:62bc7f80d7d9addd2b47bbb532de7a1d05cbc75e756cc3320edcb7a2fdf4f9c2:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_08505567d0d0499ab648b9f9612f0adc",
      "statement": "Agent workspaces live at <repository root>/.sebastian/workspaces/<issueNumber> as a git worktree on branch sebastian/issue-<n> created with `worktree add -B <branch> <path> main`, and an existing directory is returned untouched rather than recreated.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Agent/ImplementSpec.cs#L88-L104",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:51fb2ed010c301c869f200f67b9353fe0a918306bc336b09de4a14e620da3533:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f6a4f6ac03734a0b877281f6332004ab",
      "statement": "A workspace directory is the only durable product of a run: nothing in the pipeline commits, so deleting .sebastian/workspaces/<issue> destroys the agent's uncommitted work with no recovery path, while the same deletion is the only supported way to reset a run onto a fresh base.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Agent/ImplementSpec.cs#L50-L51",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:32d5e46dd9e3d1c117e051c9962cec18c472fd08dbb9c983b249cbbdd358b720:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Agent/ImplementSpec.cs#L95-L99",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:59866d8135ddd7d25778fa5d3545c4bb62174c24cf1b7532fa534fdbc8b66388:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e27ff236d96e4f4886b2ed93f5fa8d5a",
      "statement": "The webhook endpoint is anonymous and trusted solely via the HMAC secret passed to MapGitHubWebhooks, and because the secret is read once at composition time from IOptions<SebastianConfig>.Value, changing GitHub:WebhookSecret requires a restart.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Program.cs#L40-L47",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ae703da5b213c015d96da29c802eb50f80474ecdef1652da6c79aec732759a36:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Configuration/SebastianConfig.cs#L20-L33",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:eb1a2544d5fac0e77f2ce4fd84de9b669df34c0ca580ab6c5c24df50624a3bba:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_bea9f6e2a9e54d1998a90e308725d883",
      "statement": "The webhook route path is not defined in this repository — MapGitHubWebhooks is called with only the secret, so the path is the Octokit library default — and no listening address is configured anywhere (no UseUrls, Kestrel endpoint, launch profile, or ASPNETCORE_URLS reference), so the port comes from standard ASP.NET Core hosting configuration.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Program.cs#L46-L47",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:249f502f71258975f361ec1b9f2cf31d4bf21a5457c3cbcc4fab521eafecd282:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_df31c7e2108e4bc59cbbb75afb4e0f23",
      "statement": "Runtime concurrency is bounded by JobQueue's MaxConcurrentJobs of 10 and by ImplementSpec's static PrepareLock semaphore, which serializes fetch, fast-forward, and worktree creation across all jobs in the process; the semaphore is per-process, so two hosts against one clone share no serialization.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Agent/ImplementSpec.cs#L23-L24",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0576f1b593e9868ab2b453e66c149e20168af01fd386b5f8b9e124a0220ee8c7:"
        },
