    {
      "id": "claim_fd341d5eeef84b7c8533ea1e49cc93be",
      "statement": "The published artifact is a native AOT binary (PublishAot with IlcOptimizationPreference Size and the generated configuration binder, InvariantGlobalization, TreatWarningsAsErrors with AnalysisLevel latest-all), and tests/** is excluded from the web project, so publishing neither compiles nor runs the test suite.",
