    {
      "id": "claim_a57dc880f1d04d25aafcba92bcf38b07",
      "statement": "Intake performs its two GitHub writes with no try/catch, no retry, and no idempotency, so a failing call makes the delivery fail and a GitHub redelivery after a partial success posts a second identical comment.",
