    {
      "id": "claim_19cef454e0454c06aa2b9ac15c56e679",
      "statement": "The only committed workflow is .github/workflows/openwiki-update.yml, a documentation job scheduled daily at 08:00 UTC plus workflow_dispatch that installs the openwiki CLI, opens a pull request limited to the wiki paths, and never builds, tests, or publishes this application — so there is no deployment pipeline in the repository.",
